From 0be3f48f76c38da7eb04a3afe387ef3cec29af2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Jun 2024 20:24:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Implement Dogecoin's DAA (#11)

Add `Consensus::DaaParams`, because the DAA parameters on Dogecoin vary based on height.

Dogecoin solves this adding a height parameter to `GetConsensus`, but this seems like an ugly solution, instead we add `DaaParamsAtHeight` to `Consensus::Params`.

(cherry picked from commit a122ebc5c0d8408fecbaf19f817cb14631a5f434)

